{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01V7izBcLDzfUuUaZxsFMxoa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Portfolio Program â€” Master Plan (Crucible Stage 1): Session Summary\n\nGrounded bullet claims, each traceable to the member documents (`crucible/MASTER-PLAN.md`, `crucible/PROGRAM-SEQUENCE.md`).\n\n## Locked objective\n- **North Star (LOCKED):** build a deep, self-improving, model-agnostic skill repository in Skill Foundry where every skill carries a locked North Star, journals its own real-use experience, and is improved during \"sleep\" sessions *without drifting* from its designed purpose. *(MASTER-PLAN L3â€“7)*\n- **First end-to-end proof:** a recreate-a-paper recipe that reproduces the Gelman ANOVA paper, **graded on architecture/handoff success â€” NOT reproduction fidelity.** *(MASTER-PLAN L6â€“7, L120â€“121)*\n- Six inclusion criteria (every plan element must serve â‰¥1): **NS1** self-improving, **NS2** no-regression, **NS3** no-drift, **NS4** model-agnostic (persona = method + logical tier), **NS5** clean handoffs, **NS6** the proof. *(MASTER-PLAN L114â€“121)*\n\n## Convergence outcome (the session's decisions)\n- **Stage-1 Shark-Tank (2026-06-20)** ran to convergence: 3 Sharks raised 3 â‰¥2-agree BLOCKERs + 2 MAJORs; a **round-2 substrate-verified pass** found the v2 gate \"sound in plumbing but unsound in semantics.\" *(MASTER-PLAN L14, L38â€“39)*\n- **Scope fork resolved by the user (convergence authority): BREADTH-FIRST** â€” build all five cognitive skills to production depth (full canary sets + journals), *then* the recreate-a-paper slice. *(MASTER-PLAN L15â€“17)*\n- The plan went through **v2 â†’ v3 â†’ v4-hardened** revisions, accumulating FIX-1 through FIX-15. *(MASTER-PLAN L19â€“89)*\n\n## Governing principle that emerged\n- **PRINCIPLE-D (deterministic-gate rule):** the no-regression GATE emits TAP `ok`/`not ok` *only* from deterministic checks (numeric tolerance, unit tests, path/schema existence). **LLM-judge and cross-family judging are ADVISORY** â€” they write a recorded report artifact and never emit a gate verdict. *(MASTER-PLAN L42â€“49)*\n- Rationale: a non-deterministic judge can no longer flip the gate, and an unreachable cross-family host can no longer HALT the build (Foreman HALT is terminal, so judging must stay out of the gate path). This **corrected the earlier false v2 FIX-7**. *(MASTER-PLAN L45â€“49)*\n\n## Key structural corrections made this session\n- **FIX-12 [CORRECTED]:** the program is **NOT one monolithic Foreman plan.** Only Phase 0 (shared infra) is the immediate Foreman plan; **each cognitive skill is its own researchPrime â†’ skill Crucible â†’ Foreman â†’ Learn cycle** â€” restoring the user's original cadence. A structural done-floor alone yields a generic skill; the *method* must come from per-skill research. *(MASTER-PLAN L66â€“74; PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L9â€“35)*\n- **FIX-8 (anti-fabrication floor):** the slice's emitted statistic is bound to the firewall-verified module's output on the same input (tolerance-identical), defeating input-proportional fabrication â€” without grading fidelity. *(MASTER-PLAN L50â€“56)*\n- **FIX-13 (NS1 is gated, not asserted):** the self-improvement criterion is **regression-then-recovery** (inject a known canary-failing defect; a real sleep cycle must recover it) â€” a no-op/rollback cannot pass. *(MASTER-PLAN L75â€“79)*\n- **FIX-14 (journal provenance):** build-time journal entries come from **genuine dogfood/canary executions**, not hand-fabricated prose; the NS1 proof distills only from genuine-execution entries (so it isn't circular). *(MASTER-PLAN L80â€“84)*\n\n## Phase sequence (one Foreman plan set, honestly multi-wave)\n- **Phase 0 â€” shared infrastructure (~6 waves, the single hard dependency):** eval harness on Foreman substrate opening with a **Wave-0 go/no-go spike** (P0.A); machine-checkable handoff contract (P0.B); skill-repo templates + **net-new tierâ†’model table with a swap test** (P0.C); journal + sleep loop (P0.D); governance wiring + append-only canary versioning (P0.E); citation hygiene/provenance (P0.F). *(MASTER-PLAN L136â€“162)*\n- **Phases 1â€“5 â€” cognitive skills:** Gandalf (critical review, first because it is the Review engine; tier Fable 5), Ramanujan (math/algorithm; emits the understandâ†’build firewall), Literature review (moved early), Data analysis, Analytic+ML code co-designed with Code verification. *(MASTER-PLAN L163â€“180)*\n- **Phase 6 â€” recreate-a-paper slice (THE PROOF)** and **Phase 7 â€” NS1 self-improvement demonstration (~1 wave).** *(MASTER-PLAN L182â€“193)*\n\n## Per-skill \"DONE\" floor (TAP-gated)\n- A cognitive skill is done iff: a `NORTH-STAR.md` with â‰¥3 machine-checkable non-goals (negative canaries); a frozen set of â‰¥K deterministic canaries; a `journal/` of â‰¥M genuine-execution entries (7-field schema); and all P0 gates green + `map.json` registered. K/M set at Stage 2. *(MASTER-PLAN L91â€“98)*\n\n## Program-level decisions beyond the Master Plan\n- **Skill-to-skill composition is foundational (user, 2026-06-20):** the portfolio is core skills + compositional skills that *call* base skills (never rebuild a capability); requires a typed skill-invocation contract paired with the P0.B handoff contract. *(PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L83â€“93)*\n- **\"Deep-think advisor / magic Gandalf\" is DEFERRED** to its own later compositional cycle â€” SITUATE/ELEVATE are un-researched and overlap Crucible/Jumper/researchPrime; vetting must be an honest risk-label, not a kill-filter. *(PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L95â€“104)*\n- **Trio audit done (2026-06-20):** verdict â€” trio is good-enough, don't detour; two cheap wins approved (C3 Crucible complexity-triage, F3 Foreman bounded plan-amendment halt). *(PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L111â€“115)*\n- **The trio must self-improve too:** once Phase-0 sleep infra exists, researchPrime/Crucible/Foreman get their own NORTH-STAR/journal/LESSONS and enter the sleep loop, seeded from real sessions (incl. this one â€” researchPrime caught its own citation errors; Crucible caught its own wrong FIX-16 + the breadth-first mis-reconciliation). *(PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L117â€“131)*\n- **Lesson captured (Gandalf cycle, 2026-06-21):** every future skill's Stage-2 plan must include an explicit \"author SKILL.md\" wave with its own done-when â€” Gandalf's plan gated on canaries + seam code but never made the stateless SKILL.md a deliverable, so Foreman built the engine with no SKILL.md. *(PROGRAM-SEQUENCE L26â€“32)*\n\nOne note on grounding: the documents are dated 2026-06-20/21 and describe the Shark-Tank as already converged; I'm summarizing the artifacts as written, not re-verifying that the gates currently pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4747,"cache_read_input_tokens":38507,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4747},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"13e9765a-1629-4fcc-8a10-f82dd2e18972","uuid":"fd7b1a46-1be8-4852-931f-614203f033a0","request_id":"req_011CcKGm2UYpLp2wPr8wHmTt"}
